	'Sill「............」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'But Sill wasn’t used to Rance hugging her and not'
	R
	'saying anything for so long.'
	R
	'She blushed and fidgeted, unsure what to do.'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Sill「............」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'In any case, Sill made her flustered hands calm'
	R
	'down.'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Sill「............」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance’s arms were in front of her.'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Sill「...Master Rance...」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Sill whispered.'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Sill「...Master Rance...」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Sill gently put her hands on Rance’s.'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「...Is it the end...?」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Sill「Master Rance...'
	R
	'     It’s strange to see you so timid...」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「I guess it is...」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Sill「...Yes.」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「Should we do it, then?」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Sill「...Huh??」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「If this is the end, it’d be our loss not to.'
	R
	'      Gahahahahahaha!!'
	R
	'      Sill, get out your ass!!」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Sill「Hiin... Why’d it turn into this...?」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「Gahahahahahaha!!」'
	\L_055ec:
	\0:
*L_03a96:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum「Hmmmm... What are they doing...?'
	R
	'          I’m tired of waiting...'
	R
	'          Maybe I should attack...」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum was whispering something dangerous.'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Warg ascended to the area above its eyes.'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Warg「Is here good, Lassie?」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Lassie「Woof!!」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Warg「Okay... Now then...'
	R
	'     Um... Would dreams about heroes be good??」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Lassie「Woof woof woof!」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Warg「Ah, that’s right.'
	R
	'     Dreams of war.'
	R
	'     Thanks, Lassie...」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Warg smiled while she placed her palms on Rudrasaum'
	R
	'and rubbed her cheek against it.'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Warg「...Sleepy time... Sleepy time...」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Warg started to gently sing.'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Lassie「Woof woof... Woof woof...」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Lassie sang in sync with her.'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum「...Hm?」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum’s eyes twitched.'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Warg「Sleepy time... Mr. Whale... Sleepy time...'
	R
	'     Be a good kid... Sleepy time...'
	R
	'     Sleepy time...」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Lassie「Woof woof woof...」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Glittering light began to spill from Warg’s body.'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum「...Mm... Mmmm...」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum slowly blinked.'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Warg「Sleepy time... Sleepy time...」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Lassie「Woof woof... Woof woof woof...」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'The light spilling from Warg enveloped her, then'
	R
	'permeated into Rudrasaum.'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum「...Mm～～...」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum’s eyelids slowly lowered.'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Then they finally closed, and snores began to come'
	R
	'from Rudrasaum’s whale-like mouth.'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Warg「...Good kid... You went to sleep...'
	R
	'     Now...」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Notably more light spilled from Warg’s body.'
	R
	'Then it was all absorbed into Rudrasaum...'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum「............」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum「...Hee...」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum「Hee... Heehee... How cute...'
	R
	'          They’re suffering... Heehee...」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum「...Kill each other... Um num...」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum seemed to be enjoying itself as it'
	R
	'sleeptalked.'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Warg「Huhu... How cute...'
	R
	'     I’ll show you more and more...'
	R
	'     Mr. Whale.」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Lassie「Woof woof!」'
	\L_055ec:
	\0:
*L_03d18:
	ZH 1:
	'Sill’s body was enveloped in a massive block of'
	R
	'ice and fell in front of Rance.'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「S-S-Sill... Sill!!'
	R
	'      Sill, Sill, Sill!!」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance ran up to her and hit the ice.'
	R
	'No matter how much he hit it, the ice didn’t break.'
	R
	'Sill’s expression remained the same inside.'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「Siiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiill!!」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'　　＜crackkk＞'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'He hit the ice so hard it broke his arm, but the ice'
	R
	'remained intact...'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「...Bastaaaaard!!!」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum「Heeheehee... There’s no point in doing'
	R
	'          that.'
	R
	'          Nobody can do anything about it but me.」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum「You want her back, don’t you?」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「............」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum「Heehee... What fun...'
	R
	'          Your heart is full of rage...'
	R
	'          I love that... Hee.」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「You’re just a whale, you can’t do this!!'
	R
	'      Turn Sill back to normal right now!!」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum「No.」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「Whaaaaaaaaat!!??」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum「If you want her back, entertain me.'
	R
	'          Okay?」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「Aaaaaargh...」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rudrasaum「I’ll be watching from here.'
	R
	'          If you don’t do a good job, I’ll break her'
	R
	'          to pieces.」'
	\L_055ec:
	\0:
*L_03e77:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_055ec:
	\0:
*L_03e8b:
	ZH 1:
	'Sill「Haah... Haah...」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「Sill!!'
	R
	'      Can’t you walk as fast as me?」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Sill「I-I’m sorry... B-But...'
	R
	'     The luggage is heavy... Master Rance...」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「I’m sure it is. Gahahaha.」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Sill「W-What in the world is it?'
	R
	'     This is... really heavy...」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「Gold.」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Sill「Huh...? All of it?」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「Gahahahahahahaha, that’s right.'
	R
	'      That’s my entire salary I got as a king.」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「The value of gold goes up in times of chaos.'
	R
	'      This should be enough to screw around for a'
	R
	'      while.」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「Maybe I could buy some houses here and there'
	R
	'      and enjoy the brothels...」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「I’ll buy a house near a hot spring too...'
	R
	'      Mhm, it’ll be like a neverending dream.」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「So don’t drop even a little, Sill.'
	R
	'      You’ll be punished severely if you do.」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Sill「Y-Yes... I’ll try...」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance「Gahahahahahaha!!'
	R
	'      Now, let’s go, Sill!!'
	R
	'      Let’s race! Readyyyyy, go!!」'
	\L_055ec:
	ZH 1:
	'Sill「Ah... Wait, please...'
	R
	'     Hii... Haah...」'
	\L_055ec:
	\0:
